<title>HUNGARY: Hungary three-yr govt bond yield falls to 21.33pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary three-yr govt bond yield falls to 21.33pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's three-year government bonds was set by auction at 21.33 percent, down from 22.73 percent at an auction on Oct 24, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Thursday.</p>
<p>BOND OF THE 1999/D SERIES  HTBJ</p>
<p>    Total on offer	    15,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     53,338.41 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	   15,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		16,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	  21.33 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		  101.43 pct</p>
</text>
